<text format-version="0.2" work-id="w-nanshi" book-id="b-nanshi-051" chapter-id="c-nanshi-051-xiaojing-sons" source-id="s-nanshi-051-xiaojing-sons-ws2027179">
  <p id="c-nanshi-051-xiaojing-sons:p001" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter"><persName id="c-nanshi-051-xiaojing-sons:p001:m0000" ref="mnv_izb_7w3">景</persName>移書告示，魏卽焚塢戍保境，不復侵略。卒於州，贈開府儀同三司，諡曰忠。子<persName id="c-nanshi-051-xiaojing-sons:p001:m0036" ref="ik4_l58_n7y">勱</persName>。</p>
  <p id="c-nanshi-051-xiaojing-sons:p002" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter"><persName id="c-nanshi-051-xiaojing-sons:p002:m0000" ref="ik4_l58_n7y">勱</persName>弟<persName id="c-nanshi-051-xiaojing-sons:p002:m0002" ref="mnv_izb_7w3_A">勸</persName>。</p>
  <p id="c-nanshi-051-xiaojing-sons:p003" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter"><persName id="c-nanshi-051-xiaojing-sons:p003:m0000" ref="mnv_izb_7w3_A">勸</persName>弟<persName id="c-nanshi-051-xiaojing-sons:p003:m0002" ref="mnv_izb_7w3_B">勉</persName>。</p>
  <p id="c-nanshi-051-xiaojing-sons:p004" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter"><persName id="c-nanshi-051-xiaojing-sons:p004:m0000" ref="mnv_izb_7w3_B">勉</persName>弟<persName id="c-nanshi-051-xiaojing-sons:p004:m0002" ref="mnv_izb_7w3_C">勃</persName>，位定州刺史，封曲江鄕侯。</p>
</text>
